    "description": "The Banking Accounts Alerts Retrieval API enables users to access a comprehensive list of alerts associated with banking accounts. This API is essential for financial service providers and applications that require real-time monitoring of account alerts for risk management or customer notification purposes. With this endpoint, developers can efficiently retrieve alert data, allowing end-users to stay informed about critical account activities. Typical consumers include banking applications, financial analysts, and regulatory compliance systems that utilize alert information for improved decision-making.",
